 ved on Mock Day\, place THREE words describing you and FOUR objects repre
 senting something about who you are - interests\, hobbies\, sports\, favo
 rite things\, memories\, places you love\, things you have achieved. You 
 will share the contents of your Brown Bag in class tomorrow\, August 13th
  . Work on the All About Me worksheet if you have time. It will be due on
  Thursday\, August 15th. The Brown Bag Biography takes precedence. The Ba
 ck to School Word Search is due by Thursday\, August 15th. *Be sure to ha
 ve your Stuart Little novel with you tomorrow!\n\nWork on Your Brown Bag 
 Biography. In the Brown Bag\, you received on Mock Day\, place THREE word
 s describing you and FOUR objects representing something about who you ar
 e - interests\, hobbies\, sports\, favorite things\, memories\, places yo
 u love\, things you have achieved. You will share the contents of your Br
 own Bag in class tomorrow\, August 13th . Work on the All About Me worksh
 eet if you have time. It will be due on Thursday\, August 15th. The Brown
