SUMMARY:Science — Welcome to 4th-grade Science! I am excited to work thi
 s year w...
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to 4th-grade Science! I am excited to work this year w
 ith a whole new edition of BJU's Science 4! The first unit is titled: Lif
 e Science Structures and Functions. What do you think the word structure 
 means? What do you think the word function means? Questions to think abou
 t: What are some kinds of living things? What living things do you see in
  the photo on page 3? (These are two 6 month old Komchatka brown bear cub
 s playing at the shoreline in Russia. What are some of the functions of l
 iving things?\n\nWelcome to 4th-grade Science! I am excited to work this 
 year with a whole new edition of BJU's Science 4! The first unit is title
 d: Life Science Structures and Functions. What do you think the word stru
 cture means? What do you think the word function means? Questions to thin
 k about: What are some kinds of living things? What living things do you 
 see in the photo on page 3? (These are two 6 month old Komchatka brown be
 ar cubs playing at the shoreline in Russia. What are some of the function
 s of living things?
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
