SUMMARY:PE — MOVE 60 minutes a day It's important to have your kiddos MO
 VE 60 minutes a day! :) (that's alot...but can be broken down into sectio
 ns if that's easier for your family time!) Here are some option you guys 
 can do together or have them do alone: Play outside (in the morning when 
 it's cooler Swim (if you have access to a pool) Do youtube workout/yoga v
 ideos Use the favs from when we were kids! Like Hula Hoops\, Jump Ropes\,
  Skip Its\, Yard Games Riding a Bike/ Going on a family walk Exercise Sca
 venger Hunt (find a scavenger hunt online and when they find each item on
  the list\, they do a workout/exercise before moving to the next one)
